&P273028 = ARM 02, 121 
#atf: lang akk 
@tablet 
@obverse 
1. a-na be-li2-ia 
#tr.ts: ana bēliya 
#tr.en: To my lord 
2. qi2-bi2-ma 
#tr.ts: qibima 
#tr.en: speak! 
3. um#-ma me-ep-tu-um _ARAD2_-ka-a-ma 
#tr.ts: umma meptum waradkama 
#tr.en: Thus Meptum, your servant: 
4. 4(disz) t,up-pa-tum 
#tr.ts: erbētu ṭuppātum 
#tr.en: (There are) 4 tablets 
5. sza _sukkal_ szu-szi-im sza elam-ma{ki#} 
#tr.ts: ša sukkal šušim ša elamma 
#tr.en: of the governor of Susa in Elam, 
6. sza i-du-ku-szu na-szu-u2 
#tr.ts: ša idūkūšu nāšû 
#tr.en: whom they killed—the carriers 
7. sza i-na ge5-er-ri-im il-qu2-nim 
#tr.ts: ša ina gerrim ilqûnim 
#tr.en: whom they in a campaign war captured— 
8. [t,up-pa]-tim# szi-na ep-te-e-[ma] 
#tr.ts: ṭuppātim šinā eptema 
#tr.en: those tablets I opened, and 
9. [um-ma a-na-ku]-ma# pi2-qa-at 
#tr.ts: umma anākuma pīqat 
#tr.en: thus I: “Perhaps 
10. [t,e4-em _a-sza3_ u3 ma-tim]-ma 
#tr.ts: ṭēm eqlim u mātimma 
#tr.en: a report of field and land 
11. [i-na li-ib-bi t,up-pa]-tim# sza-t,e4-er 
#tr.ts: ina libbi ṭuppātim šaṭer 
#tr.en: in the tablets is recorded; 
12. [szum-ma la i-pe-et-tu]-ma i-sze-mu-u2-ma 
#tr.ts: šumma la ipettûma išemmûma 
#tr.en: if they did not open and hear, 
@reverse 
1. a-na# be-li2-ia a-sza-ap-pa#-ru# 
#tr.ts: ana bēliya ašapparu 
#tr.en: if to my lord I were not to send, 
2. u3 a-na-ku t,e4-mi a-s,a#-[ba]-tu 
#tr.ts: u anāku ṭēmī aṣabbatu 
#tr.en: and if I would not myself seize my report, 
3. mi-im-ma# t,e4-mu-um i-na li-ib-bi-szi-na 
#tr.ts: mimma ṭemum ina libbišinā 
#tr.en: (then it is as if) a report in them 
4. u2-ul i-ba-asz-szi asz-szum t,e4-em 
#tr.ts: ul ibašši aššum ṭēm 
#tr.en: there was none.” Concerning the report 
5. _a-sza3_ u3 ma-tim-ma 
#tr.ts: eqlim u mātimma 
#tr.en: of field and land, 
6. a-nu-um-ma t,up-pa-tim szi-na-ti a-na be-li2-ia 
#tr.ts: anumma ṭuppātim šināti ana bēliya 
#tr.en: now these tablets to my lord 
7. usz-ta-bi-lam be-li2 li-isz-me-szi-na-ti 
#tr.ts: uštābilam bēlī lišmešināti 
#tr.en: I have sent. May my lord hear them.
